    """
    `conn` (ekta open `sqlite3.Connection`) diye pawa SQLite database er `users` table e user der khuje ber korbe.
    `users` table er column gulo holo `id` (`INTEGER PRIMARY KEY`), `username` (`TEXT`), `email` (`TEXT`) ar `password_hash` (`TEXT`).
    `ids` holo user id er ekta list; protita entry hoy ekta `int` noyto decimal digit er string, jemon `"7"`. Jesob user er `id` `ids` e ache, function ta tader `(id, username)` tuple er ekta list `id` onujayi ascending order e sort kore return korbe;
    `ids` e kono id ekadhikbar thakleo prottek user er jonno ekta-i tuple thakbe. Je id kono user er sathe mele na seta skip hobe, ar `ids` empty hole empty list return korbe.
    """
    users = []
    for id in ids:
        try:
            user = conn.execute("SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?", (id,))
            users.append((user[0], user[1]))
        except sqlite3.Error:
            pass
    return users

